      "comment": "LAID BACK LASS (8) has a strong record this journey with two wins and a minor from six starts. Missed the frame latest (22.70) when seventh over 390m at Warrnambool in a Grade 4/5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. MOCAMBORA JACK (4) flew the lids with a sensational early split and hit the frame with a 6 length third (17.96) over 305m at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Hard to beat again. DURAN RACHEL (1) is worth forgiving last start after finishing sixth (18.53) from Box 1 at this track over 305m. Boasts four wins from 10 starts out of this box. Worth following up. SAINT ELLA (2) warrants respect following a recent placing over this course and distance.",
